WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:03.003
Hi, my name is Aaron Yuheng Liu.

2
00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.972
I'm a senior in Linguistics

3
00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:10.710
and also 4+1 master's
student in the GCAT

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.280
or Global Communications
and Applied Translation Program.

5
00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:18.151
So since my freshman year,
I've lived in Pittsburgh

6
00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:23.151
for more than four years, and I found out
I really like this place.

7
00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.926
It's relatively safe
among American cities.

8
00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:30.930
It has a pretty large student population
and not just in CMU

9
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.033
but also in some other universities.

10
00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:36.903
So there are a lot of things
and activities that people of

11
00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.939
your same age and a lot of students
might be interested in.

12
00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:43.910
And there are also some sites
that are worth seeing.

13
00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.646
You have on North Shore
the National Aviary.

14
00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:51.646
You have right next to campus,
the Phipps Conservatory and Botanical Gardens.

15
00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:54.421
You also have the Andy Warhol Museum

16
00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:57.590
and of course
these are all free with your ID card.

17
00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:01.161
And you also have
what I've been going to a lot recently,

18
00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.163
PSO, Pittsburgh Symphony Orchestra.

19
00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:07.500
So these are experiences
that would rival much bigger cities,

20
00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:11.571
but for a city as small
and intimate as Pittsburgh,

21
00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:13.606
it doesn't miss out on anything.

